graph TD
  A[Raw document] --> B[Layer 1: Patterns<br/>regex, denylist, fuzzy matches]
  A --> C[Layer 2: Libraries<br/>names, places, secrets]
  B --> D[Merge detections<br/>find every repeat mention]
  C --> D
  D --> E[Replace with surrogates]
  E --> G[Encrypted mapping]
  E --> F[Anonymized text]
  F --> H[Layer 3a: Local verification]
  H -->|leak| X[Add missed values<br/>as extra terms and re-run]
  H -->|passes| I[Layer 3b: Agent audit]
  I -->|leak| X
  I -->|no direct leaks| J{Gate}
  J -->|a person accepts<br/>flagged passages| K[Reviewed output]
  class A,B,C,D,E,F,G,H,X local
  class I provider
  class J,K human
  classDef local fill:#e8f1fb,stroke:#2a78d6,color:#0b0b0b
  classDef provider fill:#fdeee7,stroke:#eb6834,color:#0b0b0b
  classDef human fill:#e5f6f0,stroke:#1baf7a,color:#0b0b0b
  classDef neutral fill:#f4f3f0,stroke:#8a8983,color:#0b0b0b
